      "widgets_values": [
        "image_qwen_image_2_1_image_edit\n\nThe editable version of a ComfyQ bundle, generated from its .api.json\nthrough ComfyUI's own frontend (tools/api-to-ui).\n\nComfyQ RUNS the .api.json, not this file. Edit here, then re-export\nthrough tools/ui-to-api/convert.mjs to change what actually runs."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
